vk-gitlab reimplements the GitLab-facing side of GitLab Runner. Its protocol behaviour
(job request, job update, incremental trace, retries and backoff, failure-reason
mapping, token shortening, system ID) follows GitLab Runner v19.5.0, and the job trace
reporter in src/trace.rs and the JobResponse types in src/job.rs are adapted from its Go
sources. The tests in tests/api_compat.rs, tests/trace_compat.rs, tests/job_fixtures.rs
and unit tests under src/ port test cases and fixtures from GitLab Runner's test suite;
each names the upstream file and test it comes from.
https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-runner/-/tree/v19.5.0

